v 3
d importR. Dual-bridge importer for R data files (.Rdata and .rds).
d
d Reads an R data file into Stata. It prefers a local R (via Rscript and the
d haven package) and falls back to Stata's Python integration with the
d pyreadstat library, so it works whichever of the two is installed.
d
d Requires: Stata 16+, and either R (with haven) or python with pyreadstat.
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
f importR.ado
f importR.sthlp
f RtoStata.py
f pythontoR.py
